      en: ["Seat of the Roman Catholic Diocese of Kankan.", "A symbol of religious peace in Upper Guinea.", "Features a simple and dignified architectural design.", "The primary location for Christian services in the region.", "Active in social work and the educational sector.", "A key site for interfaith dialogue in the city."]
